      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t understand this, the blur mask filter is used to do drop shadows on glyphs and we do cache that (and want to). It may be possible to back the blur mask filter with an image blur in the future, but that\u0027s an implementation detail and would still be a mask filter.",
